(392,826,'DEF: Includes gestational impaired glucose tolerance and gestational diabetes mellitus. DESC: Glucose tolerance changes during pregnancy; two hours after 75G glucose: venous glusose &amp;gt;= 7.8 mmol/L but &amp;lt; 11.1 mmol/L means Impaired Glucose Tolerance; venous glucose &amp;gt;= 11.1 means Diabetes Mellitus. REF: Oxford Clinical Medicine.','en',2,'2026-05-31 02:11:02',2,'2026-05-31 02:11:57','1401FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
