(1345,2817,'A highly contagious infectious disease caused by MORBILLIVIRUS, common among children but also seen in the nonimmune of any age, in which the virus enters the respiratory tract via droplet nuclei and multiplies in the epithelial cells, spreading throughout the reticuloendothelial system. (From Dorland, 27th ed)','en',2,'2026-05-31 02:13:25',NULL,NULL,'4517FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
(1346,2819,'Syndrome caused by sucking of thick meconium into the lungs, usually by term or post-term infants (often small for gestational age) either in utero or with first breath. The resultant small airway obstruction may produce respiratory distress, tachypnea, cyanosis, pneumothorax, and/or pneumomediastinum.','en',2,'2026-05-31 02:13:25',NULL,NULL,'4514FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
(1347,2823,'Disturbances in registering an impression, in the retention of an acquired impression, or in the recall of an impression. Memory impairments are associated with DEMENTIA; CRANIOCEREBRAL TRAUMA; ENCEPHALITIS; ALCOHOLISM (see also ALCOHOL AMNESTIC DISORDER); SCHIZOPHRENIA; and other conditions.','en',2,'2026-05-31 02:13:25',NULL,NULL,'4504FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
(1348,2827,'Subnormal intellectual functioning which originates during the developmental period. This has multiple potential etiologies, including genetic defects and perinatal insults. Intelligence quotient (IQ) scores are commonly used to determine whether an individual is mentally retarded. IQ scores between 70 and 79 are in the borderline mentally retarded range. Scores below 67 are in the retarded range. (Joynt, Clinical Neurology, 1992, Ch55, p28)','en',2,'2026-05-31 02:13:26',NULL,NULL,'4487FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
(1349,2828,'Generic term for diseases caused by an abnormal metabolic process. It can be congenital due to inherited enzyme abnormality (METABOLISM, INBORN ERRORS) or acquired due to disease of an endocrine organ or failure of a metabolically important organ such as the liver. (Stedman, 26th ed)','en',2,'2026-05-31 02:13:26',NULL,NULL,'4485FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
