(1395,2938,'A placenta which develops in the lower uterine segment, in the zone of dilatation, so that it covers or adjoins the internal os. Painless hemorrhage in the last trimester, particularly during the eighth month, is the most common symptom. (Dorland, 27th ed)','en',2,'2026-05-31 02:13:34',NULL,NULL,'3920FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
(1396,2939,'A condition or physical state produced by the ingestion, injection or inhalation of, or exposure to a deleterious agent.','en',2,'2026-05-31 02:13:34',NULL,NULL,'3907FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
